(6864724, 1033942, 108580, '<td valign="top">On first sighting a lovely image but your compression ratio has let it down I think. Also the antennae are very crinkled and the wings frayed and dishevelled so it leads me to believe the BF is a dead specimen, bolstered by the one errant lone foreleg grasping at the sky and not a purchase point on the plant. The "Bokeh" is very pretty.</td>', 'On first sighting a lovely image but your compression ratio has let it down I think. Also the antennae are very crinkled and the wings frayed and dishevelled so it leads me to believe the BF is a dead specimen, bolstered by the one errant lone foreleg grasping at the sky and not a purchase point on the plant. The "Bokeh" is very pretty.', '2012-09-17 03:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6864730, 1033813, 108580, '<td valign="top">Works well, being lit where the tourists are not.<br/> <br/>OMG those cell phones. Do they know how bad their image will be when displayed on that monster flat screen in their lounge later...</td>', 'Works well, being lit where the tourists are not. OMG those cell phones. Do they know how bad their image will be when displayed on that monster flat screen in their lounge later...', '2012-09-17 03:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
