(6866692, 1034006, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1, tied with another.<br/>Normally not a fan of this style, but lately I''m finding myself rating images with people much higher. The treatment on the flora in the background is a little heavy, but it works for this image. I''m imagining she''s looking back at me, longing for something. Kind of the way I look at life now. Looking back and wondering what if.</td>', '#1, tied with another.Normally not a fan of this style, but lately I''m finding myself rating images with people much higher. The treatment on the flora in the background is a little heavy, but it works for this image. I''m imagining she''s looking back at me, longing for something. Kind of the way I look at life now. Looking back and wondering what if.', '2012-09-20 16:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
