(6867633, 1033938, 113156, '<td valign="top">For a moment I thought the shadow was someone creeping up on her, nice softness in the processing and overall a good image.</td>', 'For a moment I thought the shadow was someone creeping up on her, nice softness in the processing and overall a good image.', '2012-09-22 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6867748, 1033716, 30861, '<td valign="top"><i><b>When a new planet swims into his ken? </b></i>(Couldn''t resist, haven''t voted yet. Nice, gritty shot though.)</td>', 'When a new planet swims into his ken? (Couldn''t resist, haven''t voted yet. Nice, gritty shot though.)', '2012-09-22 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6867774, 1034002, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the slight angle used here. I think the lips and eyes look a little over done in your PP. The area under his eyes are naturally dark. One little trick I use to touch this area up is to sample an area of the skin color using a 5 point average sample on your eye dropper. Then on a new blank layer use a soft brush to brush in some of the sampled color over the dark areas. Then change the opacity of the layer to suite your taste. Of course not everyone wants to photoshop their family to death so you can ignore me if that is not your style.</td>', 'I like the slight angle used here. I think the lips and eyes look a little over done in your PP. The area under his eyes are naturally dark. One little trick I use to touch this area up is to sample an area of the skin color using a 5 point average sample on your eye dropper. Then on a new blank layer use a soft brush to brush in some of the sampled color over the dark areas. Then change the opacity of the layer to suite your taste. Of course not everyone wants to photoshop their family to death so you can ignore me if that is not your style.', '2012-09-22 23:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6867778, 1033853, 10785, '<td valign="top">The colored background makes the shot.</td>', 'The colored background makes the shot.', '2012-09-22 23:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
