(6867901, 1033945, 138630, '<td valign="top">An absolutely delightful moment and a captivating smile.  Love her eyes and that we can see them both.  Not so sure about her right leg - but there it was :)  In my top ten.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'An absolutely delightful moment and a captivating smile.  Love her eyes and that we can see them both.  Not so sure about her right leg - but there it was :)  In my top ten.  Voted earlier.', '2012-09-23 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
