(6869923, 1033909, 72929, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> "Serenity now! Serenity now!"<br/>"What is that?"<br/>"The doctor gave me a relaxation cassette. When my blood pressure gets too high, the man on the tape tells me to say ''serenity now!''"<br/>"Are you supposed to yell it?"<br/>"The man on the tape wasn''t specific."<br/> <br/><i>- Frank and George, in "The Serenity Now"<br/></i> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hahaha "Serenity now, insanity later!"</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: "Serenity now! Serenity now!""What is that?""The doctor gave me a relaxation cassette. When my blood pressure gets too high, the man on the tape tells me to say ''serenity now!''""Are you supposed to yell it?""The man on the tape wasn''t specific." - Frank and George, in "The Serenity Now"  Hahaha "Serenity now, insanity later!"', '2012-09-26 12:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
